OL,3,GNEWSATories criticise 'disjointed'
OL,4,ABudget as watchdog warns of 'pretty
OL,5,Agrim' economic picture
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealey delivered his first Budget as
OL,8,Fchancellor on Wednesday - he tells the
OL,9,FBBC the government "can never remove
OL,10,Fcompletely the cost of living pressures
OL,11,Fthat people feel"
OL,13,FIn the pre-recorded interview, he also
OL,14,Fsays there "will be a reduction in the
OL,15,Fbenefits bill" before the next general
OL,16,Felection - yesterday the Conservatives
OL,17,Faccused Labour of being "addicted to
OL,18,Fwelfare"
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
